WEBVTT

00:01:28.538 --> 00:01:30.329
(Risate)

00:01:31.288 --> 00:01:33.579
E poi guardo
ed ha un cappello da cowboy,

00:01:33.579 --> 00:01:35.329
e gli faccio “Oh, ciao, dolcezza”.

00:01:35.329 --> 00:01:38.871
E poi mentre stavo uscendo,

00:01:38.871 --> 00:01:42.413
lui si tocca la tesa del cappello
e mi fa “Come va, signora”.

00:01:43.121 --> 00:01:45.079
Uuuh.

00:01:45.163 --> 00:01:46.746
Ero tipo, “Bene, ok...”

00:01:46.746 --> 00:01:48.121
(Risate)

00:01:48.121 --> 00:01:49.579
se insisti”.

00:01:49.579 --> 00:01:51.204
(Risate)

00:01:51.329 --> 00:01:52.913
“Andiamo al tuo ranch.”

00:01:52.913 --> 00:01:54.871
(Risate)

00:01:54.871 --> 00:01:57.371
Suppongo te ne diano uno
insieme al cappello.

00:01:58.996 --> 00:02:01.413
Viaggio molto per lavoro -